# Personal workspace settings. TokenGauge's setup command writes the snapshot
# path to USER settings, never here, but a hand-set workspace override would
# carry a machine-specific absolute path that is wrong on every other machine.
# launch.json and tasks.json stay tracked: those are shared dev config.
